# FMD (sibling engine)

This repo's root `AGENTS.md` is the **MATRIX build-agents** guide (glass-box + eval gates). It is **not** an FMD pointer. Do not treat it as the FMD operating guide.

**Pinned engine:** FMD v1.28.1 at `D:/PROJECTS/FMD` ([github.com/delatorrecj/fmd](https://github.com/delatorrecj/fmd) tag `v1.28.1`).

When the user asks for a formal document (PRD, SDD, DSD, RFC, QAD, SAD, BUILD, CLR, GTM, OPS, CR, INDEX, postmortem, etc.):

1. Read `D:/PROJECTS/FMD/AGENTS.md` for triggers, scale, and workflow.
2. Load the matching template from `D:/PROJECTS/FMD/templates/<NAME>_Template.md`.
3. Save filled output under this repo's `docs/` (e.g. `docs/prd-matrix.md`).
4. Validate with `python D:/PROJECTS/FMD/scripts/check.py docs/`.

Do **not** auto-load FMD `examples/`, `Playbook.md`, `plans/`, `benchmarks/`, or `CHANGELOG.md` into product/`app/` build sessions. Do not nest a second `FMD/` clone under this repo.
